MID_WD11_05_m01: <TH>
MID_WD11_05_m01_001: Drew a top-notch opponent. Just my luck.
MID_WD11_05_m01_002: Heh, better focus on the weaklings to score some\npoints and qualify.
MID_WD11_05_m02: <TH>
MID_WD11_05_m02_001: This is our first big brawl, but we'll be fine if we just\ndo what we usually do.
MID_WD11_05_m03: <TH>
MID_WD11_05_m03_001: A thief's gotta do what a thief's gotta do. Let the\ncrowd see that I got guts!
MID_WD11_05_m04: <TH>
MID_WD11_05_m04_001: Me... Beaten by these...weaklings?
MID_WD11_05_e01: <TH>
MID_WD11_05_e01_001: There we have it!
MID_WD11_05_e01_002: Emerging triumphant, after a glorious battle...
MID_WD11_05_e02: <TH>
MID_WD11_05_e01_003: Just as the rumors would have you believe—\nthe fighters of the Western Division!
MID_WD11_05_e01_004: Citizens, give a round of applause!
MID_WD11_06_m01: <TH>
MID_WD11_06_m01_001: Right! Time to show these inexperienced grunts\nwhat war is all about!
MID_WD11_06_m02: <TH>
MID_WD11_06_m02_001: Ha! Ahahaha! I got this in the bag! These guys are\nnothing but a bunch of amateurs!
MID_WD11_06_m02_002: They can work together all they want, but they'll\nnever match the teamwork of my crew.
MID_WD11_06_m03: <TH>
MID_WD11_06_m03_001: I'll pin you to my chest like another war medal!
MID_WD11_06_m04: <TH>
MID_WD11_06_m04_001: Impossible... My dreams can't be crushed into dust...\nNot here... Not like this...
MID_WD11_06_e01: <TH>
MID_WD11_06_e01_001: There we have it!
MID_WD11_06_e01_002: Emerging triumphant, after a glorious battle...
MID_WD11_06_e02: <TH>
MID_WD11_06_e01_003: Just as the rumors would have you believe—\nthe fighters of the Western Division!
MID_WD11_06_e01_004: Citizens, give a round of applause!
MID_WD11_09_m01: <TH>
MID_WD11_09_m01_001: Grrrrrr... Kill, kill, KIIILLLL!
MID_WD11_09_m02: <TH>
MID_WD11_09_m02_001: Now's not the time to pull punches. I've got to take\nthis seriously.
MID_WD11_09_m03: <TH>
MID_WD11_09_m03_001: Hey, I haven't given up, you know. On getting you\nto sell me that bow, I mean.
MID_WD11_09_m03_002: ...
MID_WD11_09_m03_003: Right. Well, you just think it over. We can discuss\nfurther after I win.
MID_WD11_09_m04: <TH>
MID_WD11_09_m04_001: No... It can't be... My bow made me invincible...
MID_WD11_09_e01: <TH>
MID_WD11_09_e01_001: There we have it!
MID_WD11_09_e01_002: Emerging triumphant, after a glorious battle...
MID_WD11_09_e02: <TH>
MID_WD11_09_e01_003: The mighty fighters of the Eastern Division!
MID_WD11_09_e01_004: Citizens, give a round of applause!
MID_WD11_10_m01: <TH>
MID_WD11_10_m01_001: I hate to tell you this, but I'm starting things off\nwith everything I've got. 
MID_WD11_10_m01_002: You're acting like an idiot! Why don't you care\nabout yourself?
MID_WD11_10_m01_003: Why can't you see that you're surrounded by people\nwho deeply care about you?
MID_WD11_10_m01_004: They all love you, Leda! And this is how you\nrepay them?
MID_WD11_10_m01_005: That's none of your business! You better shut that\nloud mouth of yours before I shut it for you!
MID_WD11_10_m02: <TH>
MID_WD11_10_m02_001: I will not lose! I will save my father!
MID_WD11_10_m02_002: Curse your reasons! Stand aside, Leda!
MID_WD11_10_m02_003: Shut up! Just because you're a stupid child doesn't\nmean you're the only one with something to lose!
MID_WD11_10_m03: <TH>
MID_WD11_10_m03_001: I will show no mercy. I don't care who stands\nagainst me!
MID_WD11_10_m04: <TH>
MID_WD11_10_m04_001: Bertrand is a good man. Why don't you at least talk\nto him?
MID_WD11_10_m04_002: You understand what I'm saying deep down, Leda.\nI know you do.
MID_WD11_10_m05: <TH>
MID_WD11_10_m05_001: So close... I can almost reach...his neck...
MID_WD11_10_m06: <TH>
MID_WD11_10_m06_001: No... I lost? And to a...kid?!
MID_WD12_09_m01: <TH>
MID_WD12_09_m01_001: I am Alexandra Tamsanqa, Silver Knight of Tellus,\nand I am ready to fight!
MID_WD12_09_m02: <TH>
MID_WD12_09_m02_001: Even though these ships are not real...my mind\nreturns to that fateful night.
MID_WD12_09_m02_002: O Sea Tyrant Cetus... How I yearn to meet\nyou again, Demonic Beast.
MID_WD12_09_m03: <TH>
MID_WD12_09_m03_001: OK. Let's do this right.
MID_WD12_09_m04: <TH>
MID_WD12_09_m04_001: I can't go any further. I need to call this what it is.\nA true defeat.
MID_WD12_09_e01: <TH>
MID_WD12_09_e01_001: There we have it!
MID_WD12_09_e01_002: Emerging triumphant, after a glorious battle...
MID_WD12_09_e02: <TH>
MID_WD12_09_e01_003: Just as the rumors would have you believe—\nthe fighters of the Western Division!
MID_WD12_09_e01_004: Citizens, give a round of applause!
MID_WD12_10_m01: <TH>
MID_WD12_10_m01_001: Don't forget what we're here to do, Nathan.
MID_WD12_10_m01_002: You take care of it. Keep me out of it.
MID_WD12_10_m01_003: Fine. But I need to know I can rely on you to watch\nmy back.
MID_WD12_10_m02: <TH>
MID_WD12_10_m02_001: Come at me when you wish. I will show you what a\nknight of Arago is capable of.
MID_WD12_10_m03: <TH>
MID_WD12_10_m03_001: I wish I could wash my hands of this business. Ah\nwell. This is a contest, and I won't shy away from it.
MID_WD12_10_m04: <TH>
MID_WD12_10_m04_001: <DLG>Orchel's mask is broken.
MID_WD12_10_m04_002: Whaaat?! The priest lady is so...so...PRETTY!
MID_WD12_10_m04_003: Oh, my! I guess I should feel flattered...
MID_WD12_10_m05: <TH>
MID_WD12_10_m05_001: Well, there it is. You're quite something, to best us.\nWhat do you say, Nathan?
MID_WD12_10_m05_002: We did try. It seems the land has great warriors yet.
MID_WD12_10_e01: <TH>
MID_WD12_10_e01_001: There we have it!
MID_WD12_10_e01_002: Emerging triumphant, after a glorious battle...
MID_WD12_10_e02: <TH>
MID_WD12_10_e01_003: Just as the rumors would have you believe—\nthe fighters of the Western Division!
MID_WD12_10_e01_004: Citizens, give a round of applause!
MID_WD12_15_m01: <TH>
MID_WD12_15_m01_001: As Mediator, I will see your end.
MID_WD12_15_m02: <TH>
MID_WD12_15_m02_001: I would see the power you have attained. Show me.
MID_WD12_15_m02_002: I do not take commands. I will defeat you of my\nown volition.
MID_WD12_15_m03: <TH>
MID_WD12_15_m03_001: I... I fall here? In this place?
MID_WD12_15_m03_002: Master Long... Zenon... Everyone, I'm so, so sorry...
MID_WD12_15_e01: <TH>
MID_WD12_15_e01_001: The match is decided!
MID_WD12_15_e01_002: After a battle of extraordinary intensity,\nthe winner is...
MID_WD12_15_e02: <TH>
MID_WD12_15_e01_003: House Lamine!
MID_WD12_15_e01_004: Everyone, let's hear a roaring cheer!
MID_WD12_16_m01: <TH>
MID_WD12_16_m01_001: To see you tremble with joy like this, when most\nbattles see you as placid as an icy pond...
MID_WD12_16_m01_002: How I envy you, White-Maned Demon. How I\nenvy you.
MID_WD12_16_m02: <TH>
MID_WD12_16_m02_001: Lay bare your soul, White-Maned Demon, that we\nmay be enraptured by battle!
MID_WD12_16_m06: <TH>
MID_WD12_16_m02_002: I'm not here to be...enraptured. There's something\nI'm fighting for, and you won't tear it away.
MID_WD12_16_m03: <TH>
MID_WD12_16_m03_001: I'm sorry. I have my own wish to fulfill.
MID_WD12_16_m05: <TH>
MID_WD12_16_m05_001: You've defeated me... Impressive... I find\nmyself...satisfied.
MID_WD12_16_e01: <TH>
MID_WD12_16_e01_001: The match is over!
MID_WD12_16_e01_002: A heart-pounding contest! And who is\nleft standing?
MID_WD12_16_e02: <TH>
MID_WD12_16_e01_003: The Fiery Mane!
MID_WD12_16_e01_004: Shower all these warriors, who fought so valiantly,\nwith praise and admiration!
MID_WD13_04_m01: <TH>
MID_WD13_04_m01_001: Rrrghhh...
MID_WD13_04_m01_002: Our foe is even more disturbing than I'd heard.
MID_WD13_04_m02: <TH>
MID_WD13_04_m02_001: You...the woman from that day. I have not forgotten.
MID_WD13_04_m02_002: A throng of people desire revenge on me. You do\nnot stand out especially.
MID_WD13_04_m03: <TH>
MID_WD13_04_m03_001: Hnk... Oogh... I will send you all to the underworld...
MID_WD13_04_m04: <TH>
MID_WD13_04_m04_001: Curse you... But this will not stop me.
MID_WD13_04_m04_002: Graah!
MID_WD13_11_m01: <TH>
MID_WD13_11_m01_001: To arms! We offer our souls and dedicate this fight\nto Yu Phas!
MID_WD13_11_m01_002: Huh. Yu Phas, eh?
MID_WD13_11_m02: <TH>
MID_WD13_11_m02_001: You're something else, you know that?
MID_WD13_11_m02_002: As are you, if the rumors of you carrying the blood\nof Dagda the Great are true.
MID_WD13_11_m02_003: Your pedigree is such that I shouldn't be surprised to\nfind you king of some nation or other.
MID_WD13_11_m02_004: I appreciate the compliment, but that sort of thing\njust isn't me.
MID_WD13_11_m03: <TH>
MID_WD13_11_m03_001: I'll be going all in. I have grand ambitions of my own\nthat I plan on seeing fulfilled.
MID_WD13_11_m04: <TH>
MID_WD13_11_m04_001: Owowow... You got me... I'll be feeling that last one.
MID_WD13_11_m04_002: Still, that was fun. I'm impressed you got the\nbetter of me.
MID_WD13_11_e01: <TH>
MID_WD13_11_e01_001: The match is decided!
MID_WD13_11_e01_002: After a battle of extraordinary intensity,\nthe winner is...
MID_WD13_11_e02: <TH>
MID_WD13_11_e01_003: Megaira's Beacon!
MID_WD13_11_e01_004: Everyone, let's hear a roaring cheer!
MID_WD13_12_m01: <TH>
MID_WD13_12_m01_001: When we first met, I thought you to be little more\nthan a minor obstacle.
MID_WD13_12_m01_002: The time has come for me to defeat you and end\nour ill-fated entanglement.
MID_WD13_12_m02: <TH>
MID_WD13_12_m02_001: I know you already know this, but I'm not planning\non losing this fight.
MID_WD13_12_m02_002: You stand before me undaunted? I see that the boy\nhas come into his own.
MID_WD13_12_m03: <TH>
MID_WD13_12_m03_001: The boy has grown strong. His skill has reached\nnew heights.
MID_WD13_12_m03_002: There is more to this than that new spear of his.\nI doubt this is coincidence.
MID_WD13_12_m03_003: How could he have attained such power in so short\na time?
MID_WD13_12_m04: <TH>
MID_WD13_12_m04_001: Wow, Theodora... You're tough.
MID_WD13_12_m04_002: Haha... Guess I lose.
MID_WD13_12_e01: <TH>
MID_WD13_12_e01_001: The match is over!
MID_WD13_12_e01_002: A heart-pounding contest! And who is\nleft standing?
MID_WD13_12_e02: <TH>
MID_WD13_12_e01_003: Megaira's Beacon!
MID_WD13_12_e01_004: Shower all these warriors, who fought so valiantly,\nwith praise and admiration!
MID_WD14_06_m01: <TH>
MID_WD14_06_m01_001: Compared to this group, we must seem like\na bunch of boring weeds.
MID_WD14_06_m01_002: But you know what? Today we're going to show\neveryone just how stubborn a bunch of weeds can be.
MID_WD14_06_m02: <TH>
MID_WD14_06_m02_001: Come on! The Heroic Games are a chance to make\nour mark.
MID_WD14_06_m02_002: Let's see to it that everyone in Dagsion knows about\nthe Rains of Palma!
MID_WD14_06_m03: <TH>
MID_WD14_06_m03_001: Aw, just like that, huh? Well, I knew I wasn't\ngonna win anyway.
MID_WD14_06_m03_002: At least I gave them a hell of a fight... I know that'd\nmake him proud.
MID_WD14_06_e01: <TH>
MID_WD14_06_e01_001: There we have it!
MID_WD14_06_e01_002: Emerging triumphant, after a glorious battle...
MID_WD14_06_e02: <TH>
MID_WD14_06_e01_003: Just as the rumors would have you believe—\nthe fighters of the Western Division!
MID_WD14_06_e01_004: Citizens, give a round of applause!
MID_BD15_08_m01: <TH>
MID_BD15_08_m01_004: Who are you? You're the most intimidating fighter\nI've met.
MID_BD15_08_m01_005: I think it's better to speak to fellow warriors with\nblows, not words.
MID_BD15_08_m01_006: So come on, White-Maned Demon. Time for a\nconversation!
MID_BD15_08_m07: <TH>
MID_BD15_08_m02_004: I can almost sense...some strange kinship here.
MID_BD15_08_m02_005: Who the hell are you?
MID_BD15_08_m02_006: The person who's going to beat you.
MID_BD15_08_m08: <TH>
MID_BD15_08_m03_005: Bertrand! It's Bertrand!
MID_BD15_08_m03_006: Much-changed...but that's him! I know it is!
MID_BD15_08_m03_007: What did you say?! THAT is Bertrand?
MID_BD15_08_m03_008: How are you still alive?
MID_BD15_08_m09: <TH>
MID_BD15_08_m04_003: That sounds like...Gilchris. And Aswan is with him!
MID_BD15_08_m04_004: Yes, keep gawking at the stands. That seems like a\nwinning strategy.
MID_BD15_08_m10: <TH>
MID_BD15_08_m05_005: You lose, kid. Don't get me wrong—you've got talent,\nno doubt about it. But you've got a long way to go.
MID_BD15_08_m05_006: That man is a monster. Execute him. Do it at once!
MID_BD15_08_m05_007: You must survive. And you must keep asking\nyourself what it is you lack.
MID_BD15_08_m05_008: Who are you? The way you handle that sword—\nit's strikingly familiar.
MID_WD15_09_m01: <TH>
MID_WD15_09_m01_001: Apologies—this is going to hurt. I am not the\nmerciful type.
MID_WD15_09_m01_002: That's fine. I've never asked an opponent for mercy.
MID_WD15_09_m01_003: As this unfolds, you may wish you had!
MID_WD15_09_m02: <TH>
MID_WD15_09_m02_001: Time to die, White-Maned Demon!
MID_WD15_09_m02_002: I don't understand what I did to incur such a\nstrong grudge.
MID_WD15_09_m03: <TH>
MID_WD15_09_m03_001: Failing so shamefully in front of Lady Iliana... I can't.\nI won't.
MID_WD15_09_m03_002: I think you just did. Your body's too weak.
MID_WD15_09_m03_003: Oogh...
MID_WD15_09_m03_004: Are you... Oh.
MID_WD15_09_m03_005: Well, that's devotion. The man's still standing after\nhe passed out.
MID_WD15_11_m01: <TH>
MID_WD15_11_m01_001: I will allow a moment for last rites before your\njourney to the underworld.
MID_WD15_11_m05: <TH>
MID_WD15_11_m01_002: No need. I'm not planning to go there anytime soon.
MID_WD15_11_m06: <TH>
MID_WD15_11_m01_003: That's the Reaper—I'm sure of it. He's come back?
MID_WD15_11_m01_004: Here to deliver the White-Maned Demon to the\nunderworld, no doubt...to Yu Phas.
MID_WD15_11_m02: <TH>
MID_WD15_11_m02_001: As my master said, it is your fate to die. Today.
MID_WD15_11_m03: <TH>
MID_WD15_11_m03_001: The man's strong, to be sure. No wonder he became\na legend of the colosseum.
MID_WD15_11_m03_002: But we're still going to beat him.
MID_WD15_11_m04: <TH>
MID_WD15_11_m04_001: I acknowledge your ability.
MID_WD15_11_m04_002: But I will undo you here and now, on behalf of\nmy master.
MID_WD15_13_m01: <TH>
MID_WD15_13_m01_001: Brother! You went all red! What happened?
MID_WD15_13_m01_002: Hey, c'mon. You know me!
MID_WD15_13_m01_003: I know you have a fierce sense of hatred right now,\nbut don't give in to it.
MID_WD15_13_m01_004: That feeling, that voice you hear—it's someone else's.\nYou can't let it take you over.
MID_WD15_13_m02: <TH>
MID_WD15_13_m02_001: I think I know how to save him.
MID_WD15_13_m02_002: It's alright! Please, put down your weapon.
MID_WD15_13_m03: <TH>
MID_WD15_13_m03_001: <DLG>Bertrand returns to normal.
MID_WD15_13_m03_002: I still can hardly believe it... You brought me back.
MID_WD15_13_m03_003: But...how can I possibly repay you?
MID_WD15_13_m03_004: Hmm. To start, you can promise not to lose\non purpose.
MID_WD15_13_m03_005: This ritual is important for the empire, so we both\nhave to do our best.
MID_WD15_13_m03_006: Heh. Alright. If that's your wish, I'll oblige and give\nit my all.